      "name": "ScriptOp_ConditionalBranch",
      "start": "0x00FAB2",
      "end": "0x00FC6C",
      "size_bytes": 442,
      "description": "Reads mode selector +2(a0), operator +3(a0), compare value / bit index +4(a0), and branch displacement +6(a0). Dispatches through 12-entry mode table at $FAC2. Evaluates relational comparison (table at $FB64) or bit tests. If condition is true, branches by +6(a0) (adda.w $6(a0), a0; rts). If false, advances past instruction (lea.l $8(a0), a0; rts).",
